    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<i>&quot;In the veil of infinity, there is still much to be discovered. Thousands are the wonders that dance among the stardust waiting to be found. There is still so much to learn from the lost leaves of time... So get out there Bean, set out to discover them all. I assure you, you won't be prepared for such a fun mystery.&quot;</i><br><br><strong>Bean</strong> is a <strong>space archaeologist</strong> who travels the universe in search of the secrets of the universe's past. On one of his journeys he stumbles upon Tapioca V, a planet full of fascinating and diverse creatures called <strong>Puddies. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/8cfddabb60431a9aaafbaec971041cab.avif?t=1738667470\" /></span><br><br>Become Bean and discover and befriend a host of different Puddies. How?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Call them out and if they are interested, they will approach you and join your herd. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/eb2ca133ae378e2c836564b867ab597f.avif?t=1738667470\" /></span><br></li><li>Pet them and if they like it, they will approach you and join your herd. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/ba76a590aa390832de4a8fa8eb31b935.avif?t=1738667470\" /></span><br></li><li>Throw them food and if they eat it, they will approach you and join your herd. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/f665b3c0ce827ec0c4227af9c82352ce.avif?t=1738667470\" /></span><br></li><li>Throw them, and if they like it, they will come and follow you.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/616dffa1d87d4b04c798fa03c771e8c6.avif?t=1738667470\" /></span><br><br>But you will find obstacles to avoid, puzzles to solve by catching and throwing things. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/ffe7d3a44d55c211b38e618f810bdfc1.avif?t=1738667470\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Cute creatures</strong>, lots of them! Puddies is centered around the creatures that give name to the game. Our crowd system can generate huge amounts of monsters on screen, so don\u2019t be overwhelmed!<br></li><li><strong>Pick and throw</strong> mechanics inspired by classic 3D adventures. Bean has a lot of passion, perhaps a bit too much! You\u2019ll have to solve all your problems by picking and throwing stuff around.<br></li><li><strong>Herding and crowd control</strong>. In your adventures you\u2019ll find yourself surrounded by Puddies. These cute little rascals can be quite mischievous, so you\u2019ll have to manage the crowd while trying to avoid hazards that hamper your progress.  <br></li><li><strong>Light-hearted puzzles and exploration</strong>. Find your way around this strange planet and try to solve the mysteries hidden in this fascinating location.<br></li><li><strong>Cell-shaded stylized graphics</strong> full of alien environments and strange structures.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/61d18f13c655458c933f87c493324bf0.poster.avif?t=1738667470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/61d18f13c655458c933f87c493324bf0.webm?t=1738667470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378370/extras/61d18f13c655458c933f87c493324bf0.mp4?t=1738667470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
